flowchart LR
    accTitle: Evidence requirements by GTA mod-making method
    accDescr: Arrows point from methods to their required evidence or prerequisites. Script, native, authoring, protocol and graphics checks establish distinct facts.
    SCRIPT["CLEO scripting"]:::hub
    NATIVE["Native ASI / engine behavior"]:::hub
    ASSET["World / model / traffic authoring"]:::hub
    PROTO["Multiplayer / protocol research"]:::hub
    VIS["Graphics / navigation comparison"]:::hub
    PROFILE["Exact target/profile
Game version / executable or input hash
Architecture / supported interfaces"]:::evidence
    OPC["Script prerequisites
CLEO runtime / opcode support
Validation and compilation outputs"]:::reference
    ABI["Native evidence
SDK revision / layouts / calling convention
Signature bytes / addresses / VA vs RVA"]:::evidence
    FORMAT["Asset evidence
Format/tool version / permitted fixture
Import/export roundtrip / load checks"]:::evidence
    PACKET["Protocol evidence
Exact client/server revision
Synthetic input / observed bytes / inference"]:::evidence
    CONFIG["Comparison conditions
Dependencies / mod stack / configuration
Measured scenarios / reset behavior"]:::evidence
    GAME["Separately exercised behavior
Repeatable scenarios / observations
Untested conditions explicitly recorded"]:::gate
    SCRIPT & NATIVE & ASSET & PROTO & VIS --> PROFILE
    SCRIPT --> OPC
    NATIVE --> ABI
    ASSET --> FORMAT
    PROTO --> PACKET
    VIS --> CONFIG
    SCRIPT & NATIVE & ASSET & PROTO & VIS --> GAME

